WEBVTT

00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:29.250
MISSION 1
KILL BAD PEOPLE, EARN GOOD MONEY

00:00:42.166 --> 00:00:44.583
TARGET

00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:22.958
You really are the greatest killer
in the world.

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:25.458
Here's a hundred million. Take it.

00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:36.250
I'm sorry.
Someone paid me more to kill you.

00:01:47.375 --> 00:01:49.500
We'd be rich.

00:01:49.583 --> 00:01:51.875
RUOZHI ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

00:01:51.958 --> 00:01:53.000
One beef offal, please.

00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:55.000
Okay, right away. Do you want it spicy?

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.333
Less lungs and more tripe, please.

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:07.958
SEVEN'S BEEF OFFAL

00:02:13.416 --> 00:02:14.500
Done!

00:02:15.416 --> 00:02:17.916
So over the top.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.833
It's just a simple bowl
of beef offal, anyway.

00:02:20.333 --> 00:02:21.833
Go home and eat oxtail.

00:02:23.916 --> 00:02:26.208
Seven, don't sell beef offal anymore.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.666
Let's go be killers.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:31.083
It pays well, with great benefits
and flexible work hours.

00:02:31.166 --> 00:02:32.916
There's even an annual bonus
and traveling overseas.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.833
Where else can we find such a nice job?

00:02:35.958 --> 00:02:37.916
You said the same thing
about selling beef offal.

00:02:42.958 --> 00:02:45.708
You don't want to know your past?

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.125
Does my past
have something to do with killers?

00:02:50.208 --> 00:02:52.041
Of course not.

00:02:52.541 --> 00:02:54.791
But, if we make enough money,

00:02:54.875 --> 00:02:56.666
I can take you to Stan.

00:02:57.541 --> 00:03:00.666
There's nothing they can't do
with the technology there.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.500
They can definitely recover your memory.

00:03:05.291 --> 00:03:06.833
How much money would that take?

00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:11.625
A million yuan.

00:03:32.291 --> 00:03:34.000
<i>Hired Killer is the oldest profession</i>
<i>in the world.</i>

00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:34.916
TARGET

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.250
<i>Where there are people, there is hate.</i>

00:03:37.333 --> 00:03:39.916
<i>Where there's hate, there are killers.</i>

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.583
<i>There are generally two types of killers.</i>

00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:43.375
<i>One is full-time killers</i>
<i>that are organized and disciplined.</i>

00:03:43.458 --> 00:03:45.291
<i>They are supported by the government.</i>

00:03:45.375 --> 00:03:47.333
<i>Some countries call them special agents.</i>

00:03:47.416 --> 00:03:48.250
TARGET

00:03:48.333 --> 00:03:50.250
<i>The other is self-employed killers.</i>

00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:51.875
<i>They are usually individuals</i>
<i>with great talent.</i>

00:03:52.666 --> 00:03:54.875
<i>The top ten killers</i>
<i>are all superior fighters,</i>

00:03:54.958 --> 00:03:57.458
<i>and their services are expensive.</i>
<i>However, they will never miss a target.</i>

00:03:57.541 --> 00:04:00.125
<i>Meanwhile, killer is also</i>
<i>an indecent profession.</i>

00:04:00.208 --> 00:04:02.375
<i>Killers would need a proper job</i>
<i>to hide their identities.</i>

00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:03.291
SENIOR STYLIST

00:04:03.875 --> 00:04:05.541
Excuse me. Another beer, please.

00:04:07.041 --> 00:04:09.708
But I'm only great with scissors.

00:04:10.208 --> 00:04:11.791
How would I know how to be a killer?

00:04:13.666 --> 00:04:14.750
Throw the soda away.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.916
A young man with no past, no family,

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.708
no friends, no morals,
and no money like you

00:04:19.791 --> 00:04:22.333
is the best candidate to be a killer!

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:26.625
Crash course to become a killer!

00:04:28.083 --> 00:04:29.083
Hey!

00:04:29.166 --> 00:04:31.291
Why did you throw my chopsticks
on the floor?

00:04:32.375 --> 00:04:35.250
ESSENTIAL KILLER SKILL 1
SECRET INFILTRATION

00:04:35.958 --> 00:04:38.125
This is my newest invention.

00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:41.083
GaiBa Egg!

00:04:41.666 --> 00:04:44.583
<i>First of all,</i>
<i>imagine what you want to become.</i>

00:04:44.666 --> 00:04:47.125
<i>Then, break this GaiBa Egg.</i>

00:04:47.208 --> 00:04:50.250
<i>You'll transform into what you want to be.</i>

00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:52.375
<i>However, it's only an appearance.</i>

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:54.375
<i>You don't get</i>
<i>the relevant abilities and attributes.</i>

00:04:54.458 --> 00:04:56.083
<i>It's a wonderful invention!</i>

00:04:56.166 --> 00:05:00.000
Don't suppress yourself.
Go ahead and compliment all you want.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.583
With this GaiBa Egg,
you can be a killer yourself.

00:05:04.583 --> 00:05:06.208
You ungrateful jerk!

00:05:06.291 --> 00:05:09.000
I did all this to make a million,
so you can recover your memory!

00:05:09.083 --> 00:05:10.250
You think I did it so I can buy a mansion,

00:05:10.333 --> 00:05:12.375
sit in a luxury car, drink wine,
and smoke cigars?

00:05:12.458 --> 00:05:14.458
I did all this for you!

00:05:21.958 --> 00:05:23.166
So vulgar!

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:27.708
ESSENTIAL KILLER SKILL 2
KILL WITH ONE STRIKE

00:05:37.208 --> 00:05:38.375
The timing has to be right.

00:05:43.416 --> 00:05:44.250
Oops.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.250
You have to focus.

00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:49.041
The meatball will float up
when it's cooked.

00:05:49.125 --> 00:05:50.458
You have to pick it up once it floats up.

00:05:50.541 --> 00:05:52.458
That's when the meatball tastes the best.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.250
ESSENTIAL KILLER SKILL 3
FLEE FROM THE SCENE

00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:03.250
Super speed flying chicken!

00:06:03.916 --> 00:06:05.833
Xiao Fei is not a normal chicken.

00:06:05.916 --> 00:06:07.375
He's a flying chicken.

00:06:07.458 --> 00:06:09.583
Look at how chubby he is.
It doesn't seem like he can fly.

00:06:12.083 --> 00:06:13.791
My pants are falling!

00:06:15.791 --> 00:06:18.583
-Help! My pants are falling!
-Bye!

00:06:19.958 --> 00:06:23.416
ESSENTIAL KILLER SKILL 4
MERCILESS

00:06:42.291 --> 00:06:44.458
I cut my finger! It's bleeding!

00:06:44.541 --> 00:06:46.000
That's it, I'm done practicing.

00:06:46.083 --> 00:06:47.416
<i>Wait, wait, wait.</i>

00:06:48.041 --> 00:06:49.208
Fine.

00:06:49.291 --> 00:06:51.708
You are now a professional killer.

00:06:51.791 --> 00:06:52.625
CERTIFICATE OF GRADUATION

00:06:53.208 --> 00:06:55.041
You don't need a certificate.

00:06:55.125 --> 00:06:56.583
Actual combat experience
is what's important.

00:06:57.375 --> 00:06:58.375
Look over there.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.208
Someone is hosting
a wedding feast over there.

00:07:01.291 --> 00:07:03.541
You go there, cut the bride's hair off,

00:07:03.625 --> 00:07:04.625
and then escape.

00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:07.666
She's getting married.
It's such a special day.

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:10.875
Actually, the groom's ex-girlfriend
paid us 500 yuan to do it.

00:07:10.958 --> 00:07:12.708
Wow, that much?

00:07:13.291 --> 00:07:14.583
It's only her hair.

00:07:14.666 --> 00:07:15.500
COMBAT EXERCISE COURSE FOR A KILLER

00:07:15.583 --> 00:07:16.416
It'll grow back.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.166
Welcome to the wedding
of Mr. Chen Jiajie and Ms. Li Sanjin.

00:07:21.083 --> 00:07:23.458
What a lovely couple!

00:07:23.541 --> 00:07:25.166
What's more enviable is that

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:28.041
they are also childhood sweethearts
who grew up together.

00:07:28.125 --> 00:07:32.208
Let's take a look at the beautiful moments
they spent together!

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.833
What's there to look at? Might as well
eat a piece of roast pork instead.

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:40.833
SEVEN

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:49.958
Pig demon!

00:08:15.583 --> 00:08:17.750
<i>Why don't I have any past memories?</i>

00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:21.375
<i>What kind of person was I?</i>

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:39.125
These two childhood sweethearts
are making everyone jealous.

00:08:40.041 --> 00:08:42.666
Why are memories so beautiful?

00:08:46.208 --> 00:08:47.708
Sorry, I cut the wrong one.

00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:02.958
Shit! Run!

00:09:12.666 --> 00:09:14.416
Don't follow me!

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:15.833
Run separately!

00:09:31.041 --> 00:09:32.666
Are you from Stan?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.250
STAN ROBOT - SKILL: RESOURCE EXPLORATION
FIGHTING CAPACITY: 750

00:09:35.333 --> 00:09:38.916
I heard the technology in Stan
can recover someone's memory.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.083
Is that true?

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.625
I'm only a robot from Stan.

00:09:43.708 --> 00:09:45.875
My memories are all implanted.

00:09:45.958 --> 00:09:50.083
However, my data shows that
Stan does have that kind of technology.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.833
Is this token on the ground yours?

00:09:55.583 --> 00:09:57.291
Oh, yeah. So I dropped my token.

00:09:57.916 --> 00:09:59.708
But I've forgotten...

00:09:59.791 --> 00:10:01.666
Why do you turn the light on
in broad daylight?

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.208
My data shows that

00:10:03.291 --> 00:10:06.916
anyone with this token
is an enemy of Stan...

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.041
and must be executed.

00:10:13.333 --> 00:10:15.000
I almost died.

00:10:15.583 --> 00:10:16.708
Vandalism.

00:10:16.791 --> 00:10:18.208
Pay a 500 yuan fine.

00:10:31.916 --> 00:10:34.625
Focus. Qi Controlled Scissors!

00:11:14.583 --> 00:11:16.166
I give up.

00:11:27.041 --> 00:11:29.083
Wait! Tell me.

00:11:29.166 --> 00:11:31.291
Who am I, and why do you have to kill me?

00:11:33.041 --> 00:11:34.875
My data shows that you are--

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:46.750
Damn it! Let him finish
before you kill him!

00:11:58.333 --> 00:12:00.541
Why do you have the token
from the killer league?

00:12:03.541 --> 00:12:04.875
<i>A token from the killer league?</i>

00:12:05.916 --> 00:12:07.791
<i>Is she talking about that?</i>

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.416
Speak, or you'll die.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:14.958
Mission failed.
Initiating self-destruction.

00:12:15.041 --> 00:12:16.000
Damn!

00:12:19.375 --> 00:12:20.208
The token.

00:12:37.458 --> 00:12:39.541
Wake up! Stop sleeping!

00:12:41.875 --> 00:12:43.708
I just asked you to cut some hair...

00:12:44.208 --> 00:12:46.041
and you created an explosion.

00:12:46.625 --> 00:12:49.125
You failed the mission.
All we can eat now are steamed buns.

00:12:50.166 --> 00:12:51.500
If you're not going to eat it, I will.

00:12:54.125 --> 00:12:56.750
So delicious.
Is it because I'm too hungry?

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:04.791
Dai Bo, how do we find people
in the killer league?

00:13:05.375 --> 00:13:07.625
Killer league is
a mysterious organization.

00:13:07.708 --> 00:13:09.333
They usually come for you,

00:13:10.041 --> 00:13:11.833
and you will never find them.

00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:13.541
However,

00:13:13.625 --> 00:13:16.875
if you can enter the top 100
on the killer ranking list,

00:13:17.875 --> 00:13:20.708
a lot of killer leagues will come...

00:13:21.458 --> 00:13:24.166
and ask you to join them.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.708
SEVEN

00:13:30.291 --> 00:13:31.666
Let's do it.

00:13:32.333 --> 00:13:33.250
You can be my manager.

00:13:33.333 --> 00:13:34.500
SEVEN
SENIOR HAIR STYLIST

00:13:34.583 --> 00:13:35.875
SKILL: QI CONTROLLED SCISSORS
KILLER RANK: NO. 17,369

00:13:35.958 --> 00:13:37.041
I want to be a top 100 killer.

00:13:37.625 --> 00:13:39.041
I admire your ignorance.

00:13:39.125 --> 00:13:39.958
OWNER OF DAI BO HAIR SALON
SKILL: PROP INVENTION

00:13:40.041 --> 00:13:42.750
I've rented the Dai Bo J
Hair Salon downstairs.

00:13:42.833 --> 00:13:43.666
DAI BO J HAIR SALON

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:46.750
That would be our place to take orders.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.791
There's more.

00:13:53.541 --> 00:13:56.375
I had a new pair of scissors made for you.

00:13:57.083 --> 00:13:58.916
They can cut anything.

00:14:01.041 --> 00:14:02.500
Let me put up the couplets first.

00:14:06.791 --> 00:14:12.708
KILL BAD PEOPLE, EARN GOOD MONEY.
ARM RISES AND SWORD FALLS.

00:14:17.333 --> 00:14:20.541
Hey, beauty! Do you want to
come in for a hair wash?

00:14:21.583 --> 00:14:24.041
We also provide special services, too.

00:14:27.125 --> 00:14:27.958
Scumbag!
